<%- include("partials/header", { title: "Privacy Policy | ManyScale" }) %>

<body class="privacy-page pt-5">

  <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-xl navbar-light fixed-top py-3" id="mainNav">
    <div class="container px-4 px-lg-5">
<%- include("partials/nav") %>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="main pt-5">

    <!-- Page Title -->
    <div class="page-title">
      <div class="breadcrumbs">
        <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
          <ol class="breadcrumb">
            <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="<%= basePath %>/"><i class="bi bi-house"></i> Home</a></li>
            <li class="breadcrumb-item active current">Privacy Policy</li>
          </ol>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div><!-- End Page Title -->

    <div class="container section-title" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>Last updated: June 2025</p>
    </div>

    <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-8">

          <h4>1. What We Collect</h4>
          <p>ManyScale does not require registration or login. We do not collect personal information from visitors browsing the database. If you submit a contact message or suggest a measure, you voluntarily provide your name and email address, which are used solely to respond to your inquiry.</p>

          <h4 class="mt-4">2. Analytics</h4>
          <p>We use a self-hosted instance of Plausible Analytics to understand how the site is used in aggregate. Plausible does not use cookies and does not collect personally identifiable information. No data is shared with third parties for advertising purposes.</p>

          <h4 class="mt-4">3. Cookies</h4>
          <p>This site does not set tracking or advertising cookies. Session-level browser storage may be used for interface preferences (such as filter state) and is not transmitted to our servers.</p>

          <h4 class="mt-4">4. Contact Form Data</h4>
          <p>Information submitted through our contact or measure-suggestion forms (name, email, and message content) is transmitted via email to the ManyScale team and is not stored in a database. We use this information only to respond to your message and do not share it with third parties.</p>

          <h4 class="mt-4">5. Third-Party Services</h4>
          <p>This site uses Google Fonts, loaded from Google's servers. Google may collect usage data in accordance with their own privacy policy. No other third-party tracking or advertising services are used.</p>

          <h4 class="mt-4">6. Data Retention</h4>
          <p>We do not retain personal data beyond what is necessary to respond to your inquiry. Aggregate analytics data is retained indefinitely in anonymised form.</p>

          <h4 class="mt-4">7. Your Rights</h4>
          <p>If you have submitted information through our contact form and wish to request its deletion, please contact us through the <a href="<%= basePath %>/#contact">contact form</a> or by email. We will respond within a reasonable timeframe.</p>

          <h4 class="mt-4">8. Changes to This Policy</h4>
          <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision.</p>

          <h4 class="mt-4">9. Contact</h4>
          <p>Questions about this privacy policy can be directed through our <a href="<%= basePath %>/#contact">contact form</a>.</p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>
